==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Jar Base (Enemy Base)|Jar Base]].
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1~7.67 seconds<sup>30f~230f</sup>.
*3 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 13.33~30 seconds<sup>400f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'boin]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**5 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**1 [[Mooth]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

